#. type: Yaml Front Matter Hash Value: description
#, no-wrap
msgid "Information about IBM Quantum on IBM Cloud logging"
msgstr "Informações sobre logging do IBM Quantum no IBM Cloud"

#. type: Yaml Front Matter Hash Value: title
#, no-wrap
msgid "Logging for IBM Quantum Compute Service"
msgstr ""

#. type: Title #
#, fuzzy, no-wrap
#| msgid "Logging for Qiskit Runtime {#logging-for-qiskit-runtime}"
msgid "Logging for IBM Quantum Compute Service {#logging-for-ibm-quantum-compute-service}"
msgstr "Logging para o Qiskit Runtime {#logging-for-qiskit-runtime}"

#. type: Plain text
#, fuzzy, no-wrap
#| msgid "IBM Cloud&reg; services, such as Qiskit Runtime, generate platform logs that you can use to investigate abnormal activity and critical actions in your account, and troubleshoot problems.\n"
msgid "IBM Cloud&reg; services, such as IBM Quantum Compute Service, generate platform logs that you can use to investigate abnormal activity and critical actions in your account, and troubleshoot problems.\n"
msgstr "Os serviços do IBM Cloud&reg;, como o Qiskit Runtime, geram logs de plataforma que você pode usar para investigar atividades anômalas e ações críticas na sua conta, além de solucionar problemas.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "You can use [IBM Cloud Logs Routing](https://cloud.ibm.com/docs/logs-router?topic=logs-router-about), which is a platform service, to route platform logs in your account to a destination of your choice by configuring a tenant that defines where platform logs are sent. For more information, see [About Logs Routing](https://cloud.ibm.com/docs/logs-router?topic=logs-router-about).\n"
msgstr "Você pode usar o [IBM Cloud Logs Routing,](https://cloud.ibm.com/docs/logs-router?topic=logs-router-about) que é um serviço de plataforma, para rotear os logs de plataforma da sua conta para um destino de sua escolha configurando um tenant que define para onde os logs de plataforma são enviados. Para mais informações, consulte [Sobre o Logs Routing.](https://cloud.ibm.com/docs/logs-router?topic=logs-router-about)\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "You can use [IBM Cloud Logs](https://cloud.ibm.com/docs/cloud-logs) to visualize and alert on platform logs that are generated in your account and routed by IBM Cloud Logs Routing to an IBM Cloud Logs instance.\n"
msgstr "Você pode usar o [IBM Cloud Logs](https://cloud.ibm.com/docs/cloud-logs) para visualizar e configurar alertas sobre os logs de plataforma gerados na sua conta e roteados pelo IBM Cloud Logs Routing para uma instância do IBM Cloud Logs.\n"

#. type: Title ##
#, no-wrap
msgid "Locations where platform logs are generated {#locations-where-platform-logs-are-generated}"
msgstr "Locais onde os logs de plataforma são gerados {#locations-where-platform-logs-are-generated}"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "IBM Cloud Container Registry generates platform logs that are displayed in your logging instances. The following table lists the locations where the automatic collection of Container Registry service logs is enabled.\n"
msgstr "O IBM Cloud Container Registry gera logs de plataforma que são exibidos nas suas instâncias de logging. A tabela a seguir lista os locais onde a coleta automática de logs do serviço Container Registry está habilitada.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"| Location                   | Are platform services logs available? |\n"
"|----------------------------|---------------------------------------|\n"
"| Washington, D.C. (us-east) |                  Yes                  |\n"
"| Frankfurt (eu-de)          |                  Yes                  |\n"
msgstr ""
"| Local                          | Os logs de serviços de plataforma estão disponíveis? |\n"
"|--------------------------------|------------------------------------------------------|\n"
"| Washington, D.C. (us-east)     |                        Sim                           |\n"
"| Frankfurt (eu-de)              |                        Sim                           |\n"

#. type: Title ##
#, no-wrap
msgid "Platform logs that are generated {#platform-logs-that-are-generated}"
msgstr "Logs de plataforma gerados {#platform-logs-that-are-generated}"

#. type: Plain text
#, fuzzy, no-wrap
#| msgid "IBM Qiskit Runtime generates platform services logs that are displayed in your logging instances for the following specific cases:\n"
msgid "IBM Quantum Compute Service generates platform services logs that are displayed in your logging instances for the following specific cases:\n"
msgstr "O IBM Qiskit Runtime gera logs de serviços de plataforma que são exibidos nas suas instâncias de logging para os seguintes casos específicos:\n"

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#, no-wrap
msgid "When the state of a job changes.\n"
msgstr "Quando o estado de um job muda.\n"

#. type: Title ##
#, no-wrap
msgid "Viewing logs from the Observability page {#viewing-logs-from-the-observability-page}"
msgstr "Visualizando logs pela página de Observabilidade {#viewing-logs-from-the-observability-page}"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "For information about launching the IBM Cloud Logs interface, see **Launching the UI** in the [IBM Cloud Logs documentation](https://cloud.ibm.com/docs/cloud-logs?topic=cloud-logs-instance-launch).\n"
msgstr "Para informações sobre como abrir a interface do IBM Cloud Logs, consulte **Iniciando a UI** na [documentação do IBM Cloud Logs.](https://cloud.ibm.com/docs/cloud-logs?topic=cloud-logs-instance-launch)\n"

#. type: Title ##
#, no-wrap
msgid "Fields by log type {#fields-by-log-type}"
msgstr "Campos por tipo de log {#fields-by-log-type}"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "For information about fields included in every platform log, see [Fields that are included in platform logs](https://cloud.ibm.com/docs/logs-router?topic=logs-router-about-platform-logs#about-platform-logs-2).\n"
msgstr "Para informações sobre os campos incluídos em todos os logs de plataforma, consulte [Campos incluídos nos logs de plataforma.](https://cloud.ibm.com/docs/logs-router?topic=logs-router-about-platform-logs#about-platform-logs-2)\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "The following fields are included in the log record.\n"
msgstr "Os campos a seguir estão incluídos no registro de log.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"| Field           | Type     | Description                                                              |\n"
"|-----------------|----------|--------------------------------------------------------------------------|\n"
"| logSourceCRN    | Required | Defines the account and flow log instance where the log is published.    |\n"
"| saveServiceCopy | Required | Defines whether IBM saves a copy of the record for operational purposes. |\n"
"| message         | Required | Description of the log that is generated.                                |\n"
msgstr ""
"| Campo           | Tipo       | Descrição                                                                                   |\n"
"|-----------------|------------|---------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------|\n"
"| logSourceCRN    | Obrigatório | Define a conta e a instância de log de fluxo onde o log é publicado.                       |\n"
"| saveServiceCopy | Obrigatório | Define se a IBM salva uma cópia do registro para fins operacionais.                         |\n"
"| message         | Obrigatório | Descrição do log gerado.                                                                    |\n"
